msgid "This public port is already in use on this exit. Keep your port by switching exit, let the exit assign a free public port, or type another port above."
msgstr "该公共端口在此出口服务器上已被占用。您可以切换出口服务器以保留此端口，或让出口服务器分配一个空闲的公共端口，也可以在上方输入其他端口。"

msgctxt "port-forwarding-view"
msgid "disabled"
